lines+=['','[Two-die OpenROAD layout](measured_two_die_floorplan.png), [two-die heatmap](measured_two_die_ir_heatmap.png). Heatmaps show actual OpenROAD per-macro terminal voltages under assumed static loads; macro-internal gradients are absent. All block LEFs are generated abstracts, not routed recognizer internals.','', '### Block-area ledger: selected 320-row/open-SRAM scenario','', '| Block | mm² | Assumed W | Measurement / assumption and source |','|---|---:|---:|---|']
